    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 4
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Seeker Swarms are insectoid Collector probes released in large numbers to neutralize organic targets. The Collectors use them to paralyze the populations of entire human colonies before moving in to collect the incapacitated bodies.</p><p>In combat, a swarm deals ongoing damage, disables cooldown-based powers, and reduces weapon accuracy. They are deployed by Collector Captains and are best countered by staying mobile and using environmental cover.</p>",
